WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.880
Experience shouldn't retire.

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:05.200
Agely turns decades of experience

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:08.040
into a business each expert owns.

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:11.400
Every day, 11,000 Americans turn 65.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:14.320
Most need income and many want to keep working.

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:16.540
Where others see a care shortage,

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:20.780
we see 65 million people with decades of experience.

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:23.480
Meet Margaret, an example expert

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:26.320
who ran a procurement company for 31 years.

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:29.480
She doesn't just fill in a form. She just talks.

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:32.340
Her agent listens, reads her documents,

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:34.280
and drafts her skills profile.

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:37.280
Nothing goes live until she says yes.

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:40.400
The agent suggests a price for 15 minutes of her time,

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.080
and then she decides.

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:43.800
On the other side is Dev,

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:46.680
a founder about to sign his first manufacturing contract.

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:50.520
His agent turns the problem into a clear brief with a budget.

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:53.200
Agent matches them on skill and on price

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:54.920
and shows where they can meet.

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:57.280
Then the people talk and then they agree.

00:00:57.280 --> 00:00:58.680
Dev picks a time.

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:00.160
Agely sets up the call

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:02.680
and holds the payment until they have met.

00:01:02.680 --> 00:01:06.360
Afterwards, Margaret tells her agent what she's advised.

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:08.960
That becomes a workflow in her own engine,

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:11.520
which gets better with every session.

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:13.880
Expertise that outlives the career.

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:16.100
Our measure of success is simple.

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:18.920
Dollars earned by people over 65.

00:01:18.920 --> 00:01:20.320
This is Agely.
